# inc-cjos0 gap 1: save real timed terrain for the v1 tag reader.
# fact: character and dungeon -- INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/elf-mage-illusions-seed1.sav
# fact: monsters cannot interfere -- fixture Freeze Monsters; wizard Genocide Everything
# fact: Wall of Fire known -- wizard Learn Any Spell (innate)
# fact: spell success -- wizard Ignore Spell Failure set to YES
# fact: mana -- fixture Infinite Mana
# fact: target terrain -- fixture pins the map; aim east from its saved position
# fact: terrain survives until save -- save immediately after casting, no waits
# Run with INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat,
# the INCURSION_LOAD above, and a unique INCURSION_RUN_DIR under logs/.
SPACE
w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
@until "HP:" ESC
w
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*5
@dump:spell-failure-option
SPACE
ESC
w
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Wall of Fire" ENTER
@until "Select Spell" m
@choose "Wall of Fire"
RIGHT ENTER
@dump:terrain-cast
@until "System Menu" ESC
@expect "System Menu"
b
@dump:saved
